"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. In 2025 on the middle, January to February came in at 26% of normal and June to July at 172%. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, with grid 30139 at 45% of normal. On grid 30441 the preliminary estimate for July to August 2026 is 58.7, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
